For the requested item and use, preserve each essential property only when it has a use-based rationale tied to interface, environment, or failure consequence. Keep historical purchasing preferences incidental. If a critical property or use condition is absent, place it unresolved and ask for the specific confirmation that determines compatibility or safety.
